WEBVTT

00:01.330 --> 00:03.270
An elite boy's school.

00:03.430 --> 00:06.270
I transferred after the semester began.

00:06.440 --> 00:09.270
I had no idea what was waiting for me.

00:09.400 --> 00:12.170
I thought it was just a school full of guys...

00:12.270 --> 00:13.540
...but why do I see a girl?

00:13.680 --> 00:14.770
I'm a guy!

00:14.880 --> 00:15.440
Huh?

00:15.540 --> 00:16.740
But that skirt...

00:16.850 --> 00:18.810
What are you saying?
You're going to wear it too.

00:18.910 --> 00:19.400
What?

00:19.520 --> 00:21.750
The three of us are in this together.

00:21.850 --> 00:23.550
Let's do a great job, okay?

00:23.650 --> 00:25.250
No!

00:25.420 --> 00:29.260
And this is how my life as a princess began...

00:30.460 --> 00:37.090
<i>After I met you, you shed</i> <i>some light onto my heart.</i>

00:37.230 --> 00:43.830
<i>I spent my days doing the</i> <i>same things all the time.</i>

00:44.740 --> 00:49.800
<i>I know what I want to</i> <i>say to you every time.</i>

00:49.950 --> 00:56.510
<i>I always have them</i> <i>hidden inside my heart.</i>

00:57.490 --> 01:02.190
<i>I know it's an important feeling...</i>

01:02.420 --> 01:07.860
<i>...and I'm keeping it warm</i> <i>to give it to you someday.</i>

01:10.170 --> 01:15.830
<i>The sound of the bells</i>
<i>I hear from far away...</i>

01:15.940 --> 01:22.740
<i>...makes my heart beat faster and</i> <i>cuts through the sky like the wind.</i>

01:22.880 --> 01:29.550
<i>After I met you, you shed</i> <i>some light onto my heart.</i>

01:29.650 --> 01:35.350
<i>I spent my days doing the</i> <i>same things all the time.</i>

01:35.560 --> 01:42.230
<i>And when it's time to tell you</i> <i>the things I've been wanting to say...</i>

01:42.360 --> 01:48.030
<i>You're my sunshine, an eternal smile!</i>

01:48.340 --> 01:58.340
<i>Our prologue, to this exciting story...</i>

02:00.650 --> 02:06.110
<i>Secrets of the past</i>

02:13.560 --> 02:17.020
School festival ended without any incident and things have finally settled down.

02:21.900 --> 02:23.870
Hello everyone!

02:31.310 --> 02:34.080
But we still have to do the princess job!

02:34.180 --> 02:35.510
What are you talking about Mikoto?

02:36.180 --> 02:38.780
Your girlfriend knows about you being a princess.

02:38.890 --> 02:40.190
There's nothing for you to worry about.

02:40.290 --> 02:42.760
We're going to make you work even harder than before.

02:42.860 --> 02:45.190
What is that supposed to mean?

02:45.390 --> 02:48.330
Mikoto's girlfriend was a beauty.

02:48.430 --> 02:49.560
Yeah.

02:49.670 --> 02:51.760
When you stand next to her, it's not like pretty boy and pretty girl.

02:51.900 --> 02:53.390
More like two pretty girls standing side by side.

02:53.500 --> 02:54.660
That's right.

02:54.770 --> 02:56.710
You two are really enjoying this, aren't you?

02:56.870 --> 02:57.570
That's right.

03:00.140 --> 03:02.510
You bastards!

03:05.680 --> 03:07.120
I'm hungry...

03:07.220 --> 03:08.770
What's for dinner tonight?

03:08.880 --> 03:10.980
I think it's fried pork cutlet.

03:12.520 --> 03:14.460
<i>To Yujirou Shihoudani</i>

03:21.400 --> 03:22.260
Ouch!

03:24.070 --> 03:25.090
What's wrong?

03:25.200 --> 03:28.100
I'm okay, I just got a paper cut.

03:28.500 --> 03:30.060
You're so clumsy.

03:34.710 --> 03:37.440
An old-fashioned way...

03:38.450 --> 03:40.310
<i>Shihoudani in P-Room...</i>

03:40.420 --> 03:42.110
<i>You have a phone call.</i>

03:43.720 --> 03:44.850
Is it from your family?

03:44.990 --> 03:46.180
Maybe.

03:46.320 --> 03:48.260
Take your time, okay?

03:48.360 --> 03:49.050
Yeah...

03:51.630 --> 03:52.690
Hello?

03:52.830 --> 03:53.920
Hello?

04:01.500 --> 04:02.770
Tsuji...

04:02.870 --> 04:04.570
Who was that call from?

04:04.840 --> 04:06.740
What do you mean?

04:06.840 --> 04:08.330
They already hung up.

04:08.710 --> 04:10.300
That's weird.

04:10.450 --> 04:12.110
It was some girl on the other end.

04:12.210 --> 04:14.950
Her name was Suzuki and said she was your cousin.

04:15.050 --> 04:16.780
Did I do something bad?

04:17.050 --> 04:20.150
No, I'll call her back later.

04:20.290 --> 04:21.720
Okay.

04:35.840 --> 04:39.300
Well, let's all go out next Sunday.

04:39.410 --> 04:40.810
Yeah, good idea.

04:41.040 --> 04:43.840
Isn't this the first time all four of us get to go out together?

04:44.210 --> 04:45.240
You're right.

04:45.350 --> 04:48.780
If you have a date Mikoto, then you don't have to come.

04:48.950 --> 04:50.710
I didn't say I have a date that day!

04:51.090 --> 04:54.960
Besides, Megumi is going shopping with Makoto that day.

04:55.090 --> 04:56.720
Your sister took her away from you?

04:56.860 --> 04:58.830
It's supposed to be a girl thing.

04:58.930 --> 05:01.520
My sister told me not to come...

05:01.930 --> 05:03.660
Your sister does look tough.

05:03.830 --> 05:05.230
She's too tough...

05:06.200 --> 05:06.960
What's wrong Tohru?

05:07.440 --> 05:09.030
I forgot my notes for English.

05:09.300 --> 05:11.170
I have to memorize it since
I'll be called on tomorrow.

05:11.410 --> 05:13.770
Sorry guys.

05:14.310 --> 05:16.040
Go ahead without me.

05:16.140 --> 05:16.700
Fine.

05:18.710 --> 05:19.770
What the heck?

05:19.880 --> 05:21.280
Who's stuff is this?

05:24.120 --> 05:26.250
Hey Yu-chan, you're just in time.

05:27.760 --> 05:29.520
It's about these...

05:32.460 --> 05:34.260
<i>To Yujirou Shihoudani</i>

05:35.160 --> 05:37.190
Did you ask for these packages?

05:37.400 --> 05:40.840
Yes, my cousin said she was going to send them to me.

05:41.040 --> 05:42.700
Remember the one who called?

05:42.840 --> 05:44.640
Yeah, but...

05:45.970 --> 05:49.070
They're in the way, I'll put them away immediately.

05:50.250 --> 05:53.110
Really? You need some help?

05:53.220 --> 05:54.510
That's okay.

05:54.720 --> 05:56.620
It's okay, I can help.

05:56.790 --> 05:59.120
No, really.

06:02.390 --> 06:03.760
Something's wrong.

06:04.630 --> 06:07.490
Did your cousin actually send you these?

06:07.730 --> 06:11.060
They're mostly from a mail-order firm and it says you ordered them.

06:12.770 --> 06:14.570
You're pretty sharp this time Mikoto.

06:14.870 --> 06:18.200
You're not involved in anything dangerous, are you?

06:18.410 --> 06:21.070
Then you should tell us...

06:19.640 --> 06:21.080
<i>Don't worry about it.</i>

06:21.180 --> 06:22.470
It's nothing serious.

06:22.580 --> 06:23.670
Shihoudani!

06:28.380 --> 06:29.580
Don't tell this to Tohru.

06:35.820 --> 06:40.350
But no matter what I asked, he kept saying not to tell Kouno about it...

06:40.900 --> 06:42.490
Yujirou...

06:42.630 --> 06:46.000
I'm sure he's in some kind of trouble.

06:48.570 --> 06:50.870
He treats us like a total stranger.

06:51.570 --> 06:53.630
I wish he could trust us more...

06:56.240 --> 06:58.240
We're his friends.

06:59.750 --> 07:01.080
You're right.

07:01.520 --> 07:05.750
Then we should cancel Sunday's plans.

07:06.020 --> 07:07.920
You never know what could happen.

07:08.060 --> 07:10.290
But what do we say to Kouno?

07:10.530 --> 07:12.430
I'm sure Shihoudani will say something about it.

07:15.100 --> 07:16.460
I got it!

07:23.270 --> 07:25.570
Can I stop by the music store?

07:25.910 --> 07:27.210
Sure.

07:27.780 --> 07:29.370
I want to get something too.

07:50.200 --> 07:52.190
You're Shihoudani, right?

07:54.270 --> 07:55.700
Do you know them, Yujirou?

07:55.800 --> 07:56.860
No...

07:56.970 --> 07:59.440
You look much cuter in person.

08:00.580 --> 08:02.740
I like it when a guy looks this cute.

08:02.840 --> 08:03.330
Huh?

08:03.450 --> 08:04.500
Shihoudani!

08:05.750 --> 08:08.110
What do you want to do with him?

08:08.320 --> 08:10.810
His friends are really cute too.

08:11.050 --> 08:12.540
Let's all have some fun.

08:12.850 --> 08:14.190
W-What?

08:15.590 --> 08:16.720
Who are you people?

08:17.060 --> 08:20.190
I can't believe we can hang out with a guy like him.

08:20.300 --> 08:21.420
You're right.

08:25.930 --> 08:28.930
Do you have some business with my companions?

08:32.870 --> 08:33.900
President Arisada?

08:42.750 --> 08:44.240
Why is he here?

08:46.890 --> 08:48.980
Can you come with us for a second?

08:49.090 --> 08:50.990
Who are you people?

08:51.160 --> 08:53.390
I think it's wise if you just follow us.

08:53.700 --> 08:55.220
If you cause a disturbance here...

08:55.330 --> 08:58.270
...you'll never be able to walk around this area again.

09:02.500 --> 09:05.100
Now please come with us.

09:09.410 --> 09:12.350
What were you people doing there?

09:12.850 --> 09:16.680
We were pretending to be bodyguards just in case.

09:16.850 --> 09:20.050
Yutaka and Mr. Sakamoto told me all about it.

09:23.460 --> 09:25.320
It's better safe than sorry, right?

09:25.430 --> 09:27.450
So I spoke to Mr. Sakamoto and...

09:27.600 --> 09:29.960
We're concerned about that stalker case from the other day...

09:30.200 --> 09:33.660
...so I said we should talk to the president about it.

09:34.900 --> 09:37.670
You made the right decision Mr. Sakamoto.

09:38.010 --> 09:42.270
We the student organization, will do the best we can to protect our princesses.

09:42.410 --> 09:46.180
But this one is a bit different from last time...

09:54.560 --> 09:55.150
Well?

09:55.490 --> 09:59.950
They were asked by some girl to approach you guys.

10:00.360 --> 10:03.130
I'm telling you, we were just told to approach them!

10:03.430 --> 10:06.060
She said her friends were looking for people to have fun with...

10:06.200 --> 10:08.730
...so she asked us to talk to them.

10:09.700 --> 10:13.700
She was like a middle school girl with an unyielding personality.

10:15.010 --> 10:21.570
Lately, our students witnessed a girl like that wandering around our school.

10:21.750 --> 10:24.720
She's asking around about Shihoudani.

10:24.850 --> 10:28.720
Especially about the relationship between him and Kouno.

10:32.260 --> 10:33.890
Could it be Sayaka?

10:37.000 --> 10:40.030
You mean that girl who is
Kouno's cousin or something?

10:40.200 --> 10:42.500
Is she involved in all this?

10:45.970 --> 10:47.240
Now...

10:47.440 --> 10:51.140
If you know anything, then I want to hear it.

10:51.480 --> 10:54.780
Can you tell us about it, Kouno?

11:08.600 --> 11:12.430
When I was little, I lost my parents in a car accident.

11:12.530 --> 11:14.660
My uncle took care of me after that.

11:17.040 --> 11:20.300
Now, this is your house from now on, Tohru.

11:47.500 --> 11:48.700
Let's play, brother.

11:50.570 --> 11:51.630
Yeah.

11:53.710 --> 11:57.410
I was still small, so they took care of me real well...

11:57.550 --> 11:59.910
...so I opened up to them rather quickly.

12:00.150 --> 12:03.590
I grew up with Sayaka as if she was my real sister...

12:03.990 --> 12:05.250
But...

12:06.320 --> 12:07.720
Yeah. Right...

12:08.090 --> 12:09.320
I know.

12:13.260 --> 12:14.560
Yeah, bye.

12:22.700 --> 12:24.610
Who were you talking to?

12:25.070 --> 12:28.530
My friend, from school...

12:42.620 --> 12:43.820
That's right.

12:43.960 --> 12:46.020
So you should go with me next time.

12:46.130 --> 12:47.220
Yeah.

12:47.500 --> 12:49.900
It's a really beautiful store.

12:50.270 --> 12:51.030
Really?

12:51.130 --> 12:52.330
Everything is colored in pink.

12:52.570 --> 12:54.040
And also...

12:54.900 --> 12:55.770
What's wrong?

12:59.840 --> 13:00.600
Sayaka!

13:01.010 --> 13:03.880
Tohru belongs to me! Get away from him!

13:13.690 --> 13:16.320
Unbelievable! Look what you did!

13:16.420 --> 13:18.020
It's her fault!

13:18.130 --> 13:20.320
I'm going to marry Tohru!

13:23.100 --> 13:29.160
Then I thought I couldn't live with them anymore, so I decided to come here...

13:30.000 --> 13:32.030
I didn't tell Sayaka about it.

13:34.980 --> 13:36.570
I see...

13:36.910 --> 13:39.240
I didn't know Kouno had that kind of past...

13:39.380 --> 13:42.440
The reason why you wanted the special privileges for being a princess...

13:42.550 --> 13:45.520
...is to live on your own without putting a heavy burden on them?

13:45.890 --> 13:46.880
Yeah.

13:47.190 --> 13:50.960
They took care of me, but I created the problem.

13:51.130 --> 13:53.460
I don't want to cause any more trouble.

13:53.860 --> 13:55.350
Very typical of you...

13:55.530 --> 13:58.900
Kouno, it wasn't just about the money after all...

13:59.270 --> 14:01.930
President Arisada, you don't seem surprised at all.

14:02.170 --> 14:05.070
I check each student very carefully.

14:05.540 --> 14:07.670
Plus if he's transferring in the middle of the semester...

14:07.780 --> 14:09.710
...then you think there's something wrong, right?

14:09.840 --> 14:11.940
That's an invasion of privacy!

14:14.280 --> 14:16.150
We do it to maintain peace in this school!

14:19.550 --> 14:20.950
You know what?

14:21.520 --> 14:24.650
My first choice was to apply to this school.

14:24.760 --> 14:25.750
I never applied, though...

14:26.130 --> 14:28.490
Why didn't you go and apply?

14:28.600 --> 14:31.120
Yeah, if you were able to transfer here in the middle of the semester...

14:31.270 --> 14:32.560
...I'm sure you would've been accepted easily.

14:33.070 --> 14:36.160
Sayaka found out I was trying to get into a dorm...

14:36.270 --> 14:37.970
...and she was totally against it.

14:38.110 --> 14:41.600
She won over my uncle with tears and begged me to reconsider.

14:42.240 --> 14:44.210
So I decided to go somewhere else instead.

14:44.710 --> 14:47.810
But I ended up here anyway.

14:48.420 --> 14:49.850
It's a funny thing.

14:49.950 --> 14:53.750
And did you get to talk this over with
Sayaka when she came here last time?

14:54.390 --> 14:55.690
Talk it over?

15:03.000 --> 15:05.090
He talked it over, but it wasn't getting anywhere.

15:05.200 --> 15:08.100
So I tactfully made her leave.

15:08.270 --> 15:09.400
You call that tactful?

15:10.200 --> 15:14.400
But now she thinks I'm your lover.

15:14.580 --> 15:16.540
That's why she's after me.

15:18.150 --> 15:22.480
Then you probably received other threats, right?

15:23.650 --> 15:26.950
You knew about this, so you told me not to tell Kouno about it...

15:27.090 --> 15:29.180
I wasn't certain about it.

15:29.290 --> 15:30.760
I'm sorry, Yujirou...

15:30.860 --> 15:34.160
Don't worry about it, it's really my fault...

15:34.300 --> 15:39.600
But if we leave it like this, then
Shihoudani will be in great danger.

15:46.170 --> 15:48.170
I'm going to see Sayaka.

15:48.780 --> 15:50.680
I can't let her keep doing this!

15:51.750 --> 15:52.910
Kouno!

15:54.850 --> 15:56.340
Wait a minute, Kouno!

15:56.480 --> 15:57.420
Kouno!

15:57.520 --> 15:58.920
Calm down,Tohru...

15:59.750 --> 16:04.220
If you're not calm, then you can't possibly talk things over.

16:05.460 --> 16:06.660
Yeah...

16:18.440 --> 16:21.930
Why does it have to be like this?

16:22.180 --> 16:23.870
She's just a kid.

16:23.980 --> 16:28.140
She's being fretful and trying to get what she wants.

16:28.280 --> 16:29.150
Yujirou...

16:29.650 --> 16:34.610
We used to get along and I thought of her as my real kid sister.

16:35.120 --> 16:39.360
I tried my best in my studies and sports, so I can be her pride and joy.

16:39.660 --> 16:43.360
I really tried to be nice to her as well...

16:44.530 --> 16:46.400
Pride and joy, eh?

16:47.500 --> 16:49.700
Maybe that was the problem.

16:49.800 --> 16:50.530
What?

16:50.640 --> 16:51.370
Why do you say that?

16:51.510 --> 16:56.470
Real siblings don't care about things like that, right?

16:57.310 --> 17:01.770
You may have tried to be the best brother you can be.

17:02.020 --> 17:07.790
But she saw you as an ideal man.

17:08.790 --> 17:14.520
Good looks and reliability, plus he's nice and has a great personality.

17:15.360 --> 17:19.460
If you had all those things, then it's easy to say she had affection for you!

17:20.130 --> 17:22.870
So it was my fault?

17:23.100 --> 17:24.940
Hey Shihoudani! That's just too much!

17:25.040 --> 17:26.440
It's not your fault!

17:26.540 --> 17:31.450
She tried to get her feelings across by hurting others around you!

17:31.550 --> 17:32.910
It's all her fault!

17:33.050 --> 17:34.170
Yujirou...

17:34.550 --> 17:37.920
But if you think it's your fault...

17:38.250 --> 17:42.380
...then it's probably because you didn't tell her how you truly feel.

17:42.990 --> 17:45.550
How I truly feel?

17:45.990 --> 17:49.260
You said you only think of her as your sister.

17:49.500 --> 17:52.020
But it didn't seem like you were trying to turn her down.

17:54.570 --> 17:58.770
I can only think of you as my younger sister.

18:00.010 --> 18:02.910
Can you think of me as your older brother?

18:03.140 --> 18:04.580
Otherwise, I can't go back.

18:04.710 --> 18:05.650
No!

18:05.810 --> 18:10.050
I've always dreamt of becoming your wife someday.

18:10.320 --> 18:12.910
Anyway, I'm contacting your father.

18:16.360 --> 18:18.160
My uncle...

18:18.660 --> 18:22.560
In his heart, he hopes that I would end up with Sayaka one day...

18:23.200 --> 18:25.500
We lived many years together...

18:25.970 --> 18:29.170
...and Sayaka is really crazy about us living together...

18:29.940 --> 18:31.060
So...

18:32.740 --> 18:38.270
If I say no, then I feel like my relationship with them is going to crumble...

18:39.250 --> 18:40.810
That frightens me...

18:42.050 --> 18:45.920
That maybe I'll end up all alone again...

19:06.440 --> 19:10.310
Father! Mother! Where are you?

19:15.180 --> 19:17.620
Didn't I tell you?

19:18.250 --> 19:21.750
That I felt alienated from my family?

19:26.690 --> 19:28.190
Don't jump to conclusions!

19:29.260 --> 19:30.530
You should just talk to them.

19:30.630 --> 19:32.500
Do you hate your brother?

19:32.600 --> 19:33.530
Of course not!

19:33.630 --> 19:34.970
Then talk to him!

19:35.100 --> 19:36.970
Tell him how you truly feel!

19:40.040 --> 19:42.270
I don't have the right to tell you what to do...

19:42.580 --> 19:46.450
But I'm glad I was able to talk with my family.

19:47.580 --> 19:48.910
Yujirou...

19:50.720 --> 19:52.950
Even if you've been with your family for so long...

19:53.050 --> 19:56.220
...there are things that can only be told in words.

19:56.360 --> 20:00.820
And there are certain things you must say since they're important.

20:01.660 --> 20:02.990
Akira...

20:03.400 --> 20:07.860
My sister, Makoto, and
I are always fighting.

20:08.300 --> 20:11.670
She's older than me, so she uses me and talks nonsense...

20:11.770 --> 20:15.000
How could that ferocious woman be Megumi's best friend?

20:15.480 --> 20:17.540
On the other hand, Megumi is so kind!

20:17.680 --> 20:20.670
Okay, okay, don't start imagining things!

20:21.650 --> 20:25.980
Anyway, even though we fight a lot, we don't hate each other.

20:26.490 --> 20:29.010
Isn't that what families are all about?

20:30.090 --> 20:32.930
Yeah, you're probably right...

20:37.260 --> 20:40.290
Anyway, I think I'll contact my uncle.

20:40.700 --> 20:43.730
That's probably a good idea, you shouldn't face this problem on your own...

20:54.920 --> 20:55.940
Sayaka!

21:06.190 --> 21:08.460
Wait Sayaka! Listen to me...

21:16.870 --> 21:17.600
Sayaka!

21:17.910 --> 21:19.070
Don't come any closer!

21:19.540 --> 21:22.140
You come closer and I'll jump!

21:41.930 --> 21:49.500
<i>If you're sad and feeling</i> <i>down, then call out to me.</i>

21:49.600 --> 21:57.670
<i>I'll be in the area, so let</i> <i>me know what's bothering you.</i>

21:58.180 --> 22:05.520
<i>If you're all by yourself,</i> <i>then you'll forget how to smile.</i>

22:05.620 --> 22:13.360
<i>A smile is something you</i> <i>share with another person.</i>

22:13.490 --> 22:23.490
<i>Hey, the future you can see</i> <i>from the classroom window...</i>

22:23.740 --> 22:30.370
<i>...is getting larger after</i> <i>taking in the sunlight.</i>

22:30.680 --> 22:32.170
<i>Smile at me!</i>

22:32.310 --> 22:40.050
<i>A smile is what makes you feel energetic!</i>

22:40.150 --> 22:46.150
<i>I want to give some smiles to you...</i>

22:46.290 --> 22:48.320
<i>...right away.</i>

22:48.600 --> 22:58.600
